{"type":"message","id":"ef2c34c7","parentId":"88dc3a9b","timestamp":"2026-02-25T16:57:40.060Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          "},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d0c69afd4a364b1caf86087c","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\skills\\claw-browser\\PLAN.md","limit":50}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":22698,"output":41,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22739,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772038654944}}
{"type":"message","id":"1081a6e7","parentId":"ef2c34c7","timestamp":"2026-02-25T16:57:40.078Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_d0c69afd4a364b1caf86087c","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# ClawBrowser OpenClaw 适配计划\n\n## 一、架构概述\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                              OpenClaw 生态系统                               │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                                             │\n│   ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────────────┐    ┌──────────────────────────┐  │\n│   │  Telegram │    │   OpenClaw Core   │    │   MCP Server (本项目)    │  │\n│   │ Discord  │───▶│   (Gateway)       │───▶│   claw-browser-mcp       │  │\n│   │ WhatsApp │    │   :18789          │    │   :3456                  │  │\n│   └──────────┘    └──────────────────┘    └────────────┬─────────────┘  │\n│                                                         │                  │\n│                                                         ▼                  │\n│                                          ┌──────────────────────────┐    │\n│                                          │   Chrome 扩展            │    │\n│                                          │   ClawBrowser            │    │\n│                                          │   (本地通信)             │    │\n│                                          └──────────────────────────┘    │\n│                                                                             │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## 二、适配方案\n\n### 方案选择：MCP Server 中间层\n\n**原因**：\n1. OpenClaw 原生支持 MCP 协议\n2. 可复用现有 MCP SDK\n3. 支持标准化工具定义，便于 AI 调用\n\n**架构**：\n```\nOpenClaw (自然语言) \n    → MCP Server (claw-browser-mcp) \n        → HTTP API Server (本地中转) \n            → Chrome Extension (background.js)\n                → 浏览器操作\n```\n\n## 三、功能模块划分\n\n### 1. Chrome 扩展 (claw-browser-extension)\n| 模块 | 文件 | 功能 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 核心配置 | manifest.json | MV3 扩展配置 |\n| 后台服务 | background.js | 指令接收/处理/执行 |\n\n[368 more lines in file. Use offset=51 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772038660072}}
{"type":"message","id":"99988de0","parentId":"1081a6e7","timestamp":"2026-02-25T16:57:44.551Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          "},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_57a0da3d4b1a49e28e93c562","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\skills\\claw-browser\\README.md","limit":50}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":23225,"output":40,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23265,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772038660079}}
{"type":"message","id":"f5e821f8","parentId":"99988de0","timestamp":"2026-02-25T16:57:44.566Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_57a0da3d4b1a49e28e93c562","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# ClawBrowser - OpenClaw 浏览器自动化工具\n\n基于 OpenClaw 原生扩展架构开发的浏览器自动化控制器，适配 OpenClaw MCP。\n\n## 核心特性\n\n- 🔐 **一次授权 24 小时有效** - 首次授权后，无需重复点击\n- 🌐 **与 OpenClaw 原生扩展兼容** - 端口 18792，Gateway Token 认证\n- 🎯 **Chrome Debugger API** - 使用原生 Debugger API，完全控制浏览器\n- 🔒 **本地运行** - 纯本地运行，无云端依赖\n- 🖱️ **Edge 兼容** - 支持 Chrome 和 Edge 浏览器\n\n---\n\n## 安装步骤\n\n### 第一步：安装 Chrome/Edge 扩展\n\n**Chrome 浏览器：**\n```bash\n# 1. 打开扩展管理\nchrome://extensions/\n\n# 2. 开启右上角\"开发者模式\"\n\n# 3. 点击\"加载已解压的扩展程序\"\n# 选择 claw-browser-extension 文件夹\n```\n\n**Edge 浏览器：**\n```bash\n# 1. 打开扩展管理\nedge://extensions/\n\n# 2. 开启左下角\"开发者模式\"\n\n# 3. 点击\"加载解包的扩展\"\n# 选择 claw-browser-extension 文件夹\n```\n\n> 📌 图标文件已从 OpenClaw 原生扩展复制，无需手动添加\n\n---\n\n### 第二步：启动 MCP 服务器\n\n```bash\n# 1. 进入目录\ncd claw-browser-mcp\n\n\n[277 more lines in file. Use offset=51 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772038664562}}
