{"type":"message","id":"b6d445c9","parentId":"70d6afe4","timestamp":"2026-02-25T17:10:01.614Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                    完美！MCP服务器现在完全正常工作了！所有21个工具都已注册并可用。\n\n**✅ 插件问题已解决！**\n\n**问题原因：** ClawBrowser使用了18792端口，但这个端口已经被OpenClaw Gateway占用了。\n\n**解决方案：** 将ClawBrowser的端口从18792改为18793\n\n**修改的文件：**\n1. `claw-browser-mcp/src/index.ts` - MCP服务器端口\n2. `claw-browser-extension/background.js` - 扩展默认端口\n3. `claw-browser-extension/options.js` - 配置页面默认端口\n4. `claw-browser-extension/options.html` - 配置页面说明和URL\n\n**当前状态：**\n- ✅ MCP服务器在18793端口正常运行\n- ✅ 所有21个浏览器工具都已注册\n- ✅ HTTP和WebSocket接口都可访问\n\n现在您可以在Chrome/Edge中重新加载扩展，配置端口为18793，然后就可以正常使用ClawBrowser插件了！ 🔥"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":40803,"output":222,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41025,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772039383949}}
