{"type":"message","id":"3bdf98c2","parentId":"36bdb3f4","timestamp":"2026-02-25T17:13:30.426Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                              看起来OpenClaw的配置中没有MCP相关的设置。让我检查一下这个ClawBrowser MCP服务器的设计方式\n\n让我查看一下MCP服务器的README或者文档"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f92abd565ca844f79edcc0ca","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\skills\\claw-browser\\README.md","limit":100}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":46645,"output":75,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46720,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772039600393}}
{"type":"message","id":"dd80be31","parentId":"3bdf98c2","timestamp":"2026-02-25T17:13:30.441Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_f92abd565ca844f79edcc0ca","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# ClawBrowser - OpenClaw 浏览器自动化工具\n\n基于 OpenClaw 原生扩展架构开发的浏览器自动化控制器，适配 OpenClaw MCP。\n\n## 核心特性\n\n- 🔐 **一次授权 24 小时有效** - 首次授权后，无需重复点击\n- 🌐 **与 OpenClaw 原生扩展兼容** - 端口 18792，Gateway Token 认证\n- 🎯 **Chrome Debugger API** - 使用原生 Debugger API，完全控制浏览器\n- 🔒 **本地运行** - 纯本地运行，无云端依赖\n- 🖱️ **Edge 兼容** - 支持 Chrome 和 Edge 浏览器\n\n---\n\n## 安装步骤\n\n### 第一步：安装 Chrome/Edge 扩展\n\n**Chrome 浏览器：**\n```bash\n# 1. 打开扩展管理\nchrome://extensions/\n\n# 2. 开启右上角\"开发者模式\"\n\n# 3. 点击\"加载已解压的扩展程序\"\n# 选择 claw-browser-extension 文件夹\n```\n\n**Edge 浏览器：**\n```bash\n# 1. 打开扩展管理\nedge://extensions/\n\n# 2. 开启左下角\"开发者模式\"\n\n# 3. 点击\"加载解包的扩展\"\n# 选择 claw-browser-extension 文件夹\n```\n\n> 📌 图标文件已从 OpenClaw 原生扩展复制，无需手动添加\n\n---\n\n### 第二步：启动 MCP 服务器\n\n```bash\n# 1. 进入目录\ncd claw-browser-mcp\n\n# 2. 安装依赖\nnpm install\n\n# 3. 编译 TypeScript\nnpm run build\n\n# 4. 启动服务器（端口 18792）\nnpm start\n\n# 或开发模式（热重载）\nnpm run dev\n```\n\n---\n\n### 第三步：获取 Gateway Token\n\n**方法一：从 OpenClaw 配置获取**\n```bash\n# 查看 OpenClaw 配置\ncat ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json\n\n# 找到 gateway.auth.token 的值\n```\n\n**方法二：首次运行 OpenClaw 时获取**\n```\nOpenClaw 首次启动会显示 Gateway Token，保存下来\n```\n\n---\n\n### 第四步：配置扩展授权\n\n1. 点击浏览器右上角的扩展图标\n2. 点击弹出窗口中的 **\"扩展设置\"**\n3. 在 \"Gateway Token\" 栏粘贴 Token\n4. 点击 **\"立即授权\"**\n\n> ✅ 授权成功后，24 小时内无需再次授权\n\n---\n\n### 第五步：配置 OpenClaw\n\n编辑 OpenClaw 配置文件 `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json`：\n\n```json5\n{\n  mcp: {\n\n[227 more lines in file. Use offset=101 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772039610435}}
{"type":"message","id":"7c3cc4ad","parentId":"dd80be31","timestamp":"2026-02-25T17:13:37.927Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          "},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b036913072e2447981bf78fc","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\skills\\claw-browser\\README.md","limit":50,"offset":100}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":47315,"output":46,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47361,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772039610442}}
{"type":"message","id":"d412805c","parentId":"7c3cc4ad","timestamp":"2026-02-25T17:13:37.944Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_b036913072e2447981bf78fc","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  mcp: {\n    servers: {\n      \"claw-browser\": {\n        command: \"npx\",\n        args: [\"-y\", \"claw-browser-mcp\"]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**或者使用 npx 方式：**\n```bash\n# 直接运行（需要先 npm install）\ncd claw-browser-mcp && npm start\n\n# 配置到 OpenClaw\nnpx -y claw-browser-mcp\n```\n\n---\n\n### 第六步：安装 Skill（可选但推荐）\n\n```bash\n# 复制 Skill 到 OpenClaw 目录\nmkdir -p ~/.openclaw/skills/claw-browser\ncp -r claw-browser-skill/* ~/.openclaw/skills/claw-browser/\n```\n\n---\n\n## 使用示例\n\n### 书签管理\n\n```\n用户: 查看我的书签\nAI: 调用 claw_get_bookmarks\n→ 返回书签列表\n\n用户: 打开知乎书签\nAI: claw_open_bookmark(keyword=\"知乎\")\n\n用户: 把淘宝、京东、拼多多归到购物文件夹\nAI: \n  1. claw_create_bookmark_folder(folderName=\"购物\")\n  2. claw_categorize_bookmark(keywords=[\"淘宝\",\"京东\",\"拼多多\"], folderName=\"购物\")\n\n用户: 搜索关于编程的书签\n\n[178 more lines in file. Use offset=150 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772039617935}}
